Third-party content

references/exports/codesys_v35sp15_ladder.xml is an example CODESYS export
taken from the "ascii-ladder" project on CODESYS Forge
(https://forge.codesys.com/u/i-campbell/ascii-ladder/), which is released
under the Unlicense. It is included as a format reference and is not
covered by the MIT License above.

The other files in references/exports/ (ctrlx_*.xml) are exports made by the
author in ctrlX PLC Engineering and are covered by the MIT License above.
